.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n312/mode/1up"}]},{"work_id":"athanasius-gentes","location":"35","corrections":[{"before":"παρ’ παρ’ ἐμαυτοῦ","after":"παρ’ ἐμαυτοῦ","reason":"중복 전치사 제거. 인쇄69열 확인.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n317/mode/1up"}]},{"work_id":"athanasius-gentes","location":"36","corrections":[{"before":"κινού μενον","after":"κινούμενον","reason":"witnesses 경계와 공백으로 나뉜 한 단어를 결합. 인쇄72열 확인. 개별 사본의 gap은 채택 lemma의 결락으로 옮기지 않는다.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n318/mode/1up"}]},{"work_id":"athanasius-gentes","location":"39","corrections":[{"before":"καὶ τοῦτο καὶ τοῦτο δὲ","after":"καὶ τοῦτο δὲ","reason":"중복 구절 제거. 인쇄77열 확인.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n321/mode/1up"}]},{"work_id":"athanasius-gentes","location":"40","corrections":[{"before":"oὐκ","after":"οὐκ","reason":"라틴 o를 그리스어 ο로 교정. 인쇄80열 확인.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n322/mode/1up"}]},{"work_id":"athanasius-gentes","location":"41","corrections":[{"before":"θεός, ὁ ὁ καὶ","after":"θεός, ὁ καὶ","reason":"중복 관사 제거. 인쇄81열 확인.","evidence_url":"https://archive.org/stream/patrologicursus78migngoog#page/n323/mode/1up"}]}]